# PureLink RNA Mini Kit — suspension cells

```asterlab
kind: experiment
id: exp-rna
schema: 1
title: PureLink RNA extraction
objective: Validate a 10-step RNA extraction workflow in the existing Run workspace.
experimental_unit: sample
primary_endpoint: RNA concentration
endpoint_method: UV absorbance (A260/A280)
endpoint_unit: ng/µL
sample_size_rationale: Four virtual samples for UI validation; this is not biological n.
planned_run_count: 1
planned_run_relationship: independent
```

```asterlab
kind: group
id: g-rna
schema: 1
name: RNA extraction
role: control
condition: PureLink RNA Mini Kit, suspension cells, <=5 x 10^6 cells
independent_n: 4
technical_repeats: 1
```

```asterlab
kind: assay
id: assay-rna
schema: 1
title: Total RNA isolation
endpoint: RNA concentration
method: UV absorbance (A260/A280)
unit: ng/µL
group_refs: [g-rna]
protocol_version_id: a5d8318e-6f1c-4dcd-a930-73a6f38d872a
```

```asterlab
kind: material
id: mat-lysis
schema: 1
name: Lysis Buffer with 1% 2-mercaptoethanol
role: treatment
condition: PureLink RNA Mini Kit; add 10 µL 2-mercaptoethanol per 1 mL Lysis Buffer
source: lab_imported
```

```asterlab
kind: material
id: mat-wash1
schema: 1
name: Wash Buffer I
role: treatment
condition: PureLink RNA Mini Kit
source: lab_imported
```

```asterlab
kind: material
id: mat-wash2
schema: 1
name: Wash Buffer II with ethanol
role: treatment
condition: PureLink RNA Mini Kit; ethanol added as directed
source: lab_imported
```

```asterlab
kind: material
id: mat-ethanol
schema: 1
name: 70% ethanol
role: treatment
condition: prepared in RNase-free water
source: lab_imported
```

```asterlab
kind: material
id: mat-water
schema: 1
name: RNase-free water
role: treatment
condition: elution reagent
source: lab_imported
```

```asterlab
kind: instrument_profile
id: inst-centrifuge
schema: 1
class: centrifuge
model: microcentrifuge
capabilities:
  - name: 2,000 x g
  - name: 12,000 x g
  - name: 4 C
constraints:
  - name: 1.5-2.0 mL tubes
source: unknown
```

```asterlab
kind: instrument_profile
id: inst-homogenizer
schema: 1
class: homogenizer
model: Homogenizer cartridge / 18-21G needle / rotor-stator
capabilities:
  - name: 12,000 x g 2 min
  - name: 18-21G needle 5-10 passes
  - name: rotor-stator 45 s
source: unknown
```

